1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
一滴酱油，要晒足一百八十天
One drop of soy sauce — 180 days of sun.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
黄豆、面粉、盐水，进缸
Soybeans, flour, brine — into the jar.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
春天下曲，夏天成酱，秋天取油
Ferment in spring, ripen in summer, draw in autumn.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
第一道抽出来，叫"生抽"
The first draw is "light" soy — shēngchōu.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
色浅、味鲜，专门提味
Pale and fresh — it seasons a dish.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
再晒久些，就成了"老抽"
Aged longer, it becomes "dark" soy — lǎochōu.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
色深、挂色，红烧靠它
Deep and glossy — it colors the braise.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
中国人说：开门七件事
An old Chinese saying — seven daily needs.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
柴米油盐酱醋茶
Firewood, rice, oil, salt, sauce, vinegar, tea.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
一瓶酱油，藏着半部厨房史
One bottle holds half a kitchen's history.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,400
这四瓶酱，你家有几瓶？
Of these four sauces, how many are yours?

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,900
从辣酱到酱油，这就是中国的灶台
From chili crisp to soy — a Chinese kitchen.
